    {
      "id": "F4C37D676518CF6C",
      "title": "&f&lEnder Mechanism&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fComplete the Ender Mechanism assembly in the exact listed order.",
        "",
        "&fUse the ordered sequenced assembly recipe. One loop guarantees one mechanism; the final Deployer holds farmersdelight:diamond_knife. Ordinary tools wear; the chapter reward version is unbreakable.",
        "",
        "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
        "&61. &fStart with Inductive Mechanism.",
        "&62. &fDeploy Chorus Fruit.",
        "&63. &fDeploy Advanced Control Circuit.",
        "&64. &fFinish under a Deployer holding Diamond Knife.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fOne loop guarantees one mechanism. Ordinary finishing tools wear; the chapter reward tool is unbreakable.",
        "",
        "&c&l! WATCH OUT&r",
        "&fSupply each step separately and keep unfinished mechanisms on their ordered assembly route."
      ],
